We're just going to talk about pretty basic scaling law stuff.

8
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,620
Some of the classic works.

9
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:29,200
How does the basic idea of scaling laws

10
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:33,120
connect to maybe things you know about from machine learning 101.

11
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:35,120
And then in two lectures, we're going

12
